<div>
  <p m="0" text="sm" font="700" text-primary>
    PASSWORD TOOL
  </p>
  <h2 m="0" mt="1" text="xl md:2xl" font="800">
    비밀번호 생성기
  </h2>
  <div grid="~ cols-1 md:cols-2" gap="4" mt="6">
    <label>
      <span class="cm-label">길이</span>
      <input
        id="password-length"
        class="cm-input"
        type="number"
        min="4"
        max="128"
        value="16"
      />
    </label>
    <div>
      <span class="cm-label">문자 구성</span>
      <div flex="~ wrap" gap="3" text="sm">
        <label flex="~" items-center gap="2">
          <input id="pw-upper" type="checkbox" checked /> 대문자
        </label>
        <label flex="~" items-center gap="2">
          <input id="pw-lower" type="checkbox" checked /> 소문자
        </label>
        <label flex="~" items-center gap="2">
          <input id="pw-number" type="checkbox" checked /> 숫자
        </label>
        <label flex="~" items-center gap="2">
          <input id="pw-symbol" type="checkbox" checked /> 기호
        </label>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div flex="~" gap="2" mt="5">
    <input
      id="password-result"
      class="cm-input"
      min-w="0"
      flex="1"
      readonly
      value=""
      aria-label="생성된 비밀번호"
    />
    <button
      id="password-copy"
      class="cm-button-secondary"
      whitespace="nowrap"
      px="4"
    >
      복사
    </button>
  </div>
  <button
    id="password-generate"
    class="cm-button-primary"
    w="full"
    mt="3"
    py="3"
  >
    비밀번호 생성
  </button>
  <p m="0" mt="4" text="sm text-muted dark:dark-text-muted">
    민감한 비밀번호는 웹사이트에 입력한 뒤 저장하지 않는 것을 권장합니다.
  </p>
</div>
